    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "9364298E4642F873",
      "text": "喜歡！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "93642A8E4642FA26",
      "text": "普通",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "EE5436582F6D2814",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳喜歡啊！太好了！\\c\\n製作超辣的三明治的時候，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的確做得一點都不費力嘛！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_01b",
      "hash64": "6640CDD8967BC082",
      "text": "普通！？\\c\\n普通喜歡還能順利製作\\n超辣的三明治，那也超厲害的！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "EE5439582F6D2D2D",
      "text": "我啊，當然是喜歡做料理！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳看我的平底鍋就知道了吧！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "EE5438582F6D2B7A",
      "text": "我們家是開食堂的！\\n將來我想繼承家業！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "EE5433582F6D22FB",
      "text": "我會進這個學園，\\n也只是因為被校長給挖角而已！！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "EE5432582F6D2148",
      "text": "所以，看到這次……\\n烏栗和杜若學長那樣……[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "EE5435582F6D2661",
      "text": "看到他們為了對戰變得那麼火熱，\\n火花四射得簡直要焦了，我都嚇到了。[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "EE5434582F6D24AE",
      "text": "能讓人這麼火熱沸騰的寶可夢對戰，\\n真的很不得了對吧。[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp02_08",
      "hash64": "EE542F582F6D1C2F",
      "text": "我也想試試看\\n把自己的火力再加～大一點！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "4600615FCBEC4FF6",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳聽我說！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "4600625FCBEC51A9",
      "text": "聽說我好像還是四天王耶！[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
