      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "73934471A505BB30",
      "text": "不曉得紫竽學姐\\n有沒有喜歡的人呢？\\r\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳有聽她說過嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
